<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 283 0 R
/T (The rapid adoption of QUIC for HTTP/3 improves connection latency and reliability. However, its UDP-based architecture and encrypted transport-layer metadata make traffic identification significantly more challenging than traditional TCP-based protocols.)
/E (The rapid adoption of QUIC for HTTP/3 improves connection latency and reliability. However, its UDP-based architecture and encrypted transport-layer metadata make traffic identification significantly more challenging than traditional TCP-based protocols.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
