>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 283 0 R
/T (Accurate classification of QUIC and Non-QUIC traffic is essential for effective network monitoring and management. As multiple applications with diverse QoS requirements use QUIC, protocol detection alone is insufficient, making application-level traffic classification equally important.)
/E (Accurate classification of QUIC and Non-QUIC traffic is essential for effective network monitoring and management. As multiple applications with diverse QoS requirements use QUIC, protocol detection alone is insufficient, making application-level traffic classification equally important.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
