/S /H4
/P 283 0 R
/T (Design a system to detect QUIC traffic from raw network packets, classify it into application categories \(Video Streaming, Web Browsing, File Download \) using observable flow features, and enforce dynamic QoS policies without decrypting packet payloads.)
/E (Design a system to detect QUIC traffic from raw network packets, classify it into application categories \(Video Streaming, Web Browsing, File Download \) using observable flow features, and enforce dynamic QoS policies without decrypting packet payloads.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
