/E (Tier 3b - ML fallback: If no rule-based match is found, an ML model classifies the flow using statistical flow features, with key contributors including short header ratio, average packet size, packet count,bytes per second etc. producing one of three outputs: QUIC, QUIC_PROBABLE, or NON-QUIC.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
